  "doorNote": "Play Open once with clampWhenFinished=true. The door is exported separately from the static environment; any lock controls remain a runtime concern.",
  "renderNote": "Blender cinematic lights, volumetric atmosphere, compositor glow and camera objects are not included in GLBs; recreate these in the target runtime using the manifest camera parameters. Candle geometry exports, point lights do not. Hidden CINEMATIC_EXTERIOR objects are excluded. The visible forest and world lighting use Mossy Forest HDRI, supplied separately at textures/environment/mossy_forest_2k.hdr; load it separately because world HDRIs are not embedded in environment.glb.",
  "spiritMaterialNote": "SpiritVeil vertex COLOR_0 carries both tint and opacity; keep vertex colors and alpha blending when replacing glTF materials. PBR normal maps remain embedded where used.",
